-- uilibAuroraLoader runtime: the loader window of the Aurora lib, on its own (no menu, no elements). Uses Build (the generated
-- Injector + GameRow, tools/gen.mjs --only). The theme is BloxStrikeAurora.lua's Default (the darker Aurora greys, crimson accent),
-- the font Roblox's Ubuntu Medium, like the menu.
--
-- local Loader = loadstring(...)()
